Input tag
It does't have any closing tag like button, paragraph.
Syntax: 
<input type= "text" placeholder="Enter your name">
Input type is the type of text in placeholder, it can be date, time, color, email, password and others too.
Placeholder has the content like, email address, passwords, username, date of birth, Pin or code.
Using <br> after input tag break the line.
Some input type and Syntax:
<input type= "text" placeholder="Enter your name">
<input type= "password" placeholder="Enter password"> *type= password make the password invisible or dot as visible.
<input type= "email" placeholder="Enter email address">
<input type= "date" placeholder="dd/mm/yyyy">
<input type= "time" placeholder="00:00">
 We can also add profile picture choosing from file 
 <input type="file"> This syntax enable choosing image from file and uploading as profile picture.
 
